   Nurra, Daniele and Zaccaroni, Annalisa and Rubini, Silva and Berto,
   Daniela and de Quiros, Yara Beraldo and Fernandez, Antonio and Morell,
   Maria and Giorda, Federica and Pautasso, Alessandra and Modesto, Paola
